# Óin without an enduring story (CR 702.195b): Óin and one Mox are two, so Óin is a 1/3 with no haste and can't attack the
# turn it arrives (CR 302.6), while Stingcaster Mage, cast beside it, attacks by its own haste, Bot2 to 18. The positive control for Óin
# is oin-the-brave-enters-as-the-third-and-attacks-at-once-with-haste.

